      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Favorited some vket worlds?\n\nI think internally the favorites is just a list of world IDs, and when the request is done, any ID that is private is replaced with ??? for the world id. At least that's what seems to happen on the website.\n\nVRchat doesn't have any permissions on private worlds, if a world goes private and you know the world id, you can make an instance on the website and invite yourself to it. This is why thier API goes out of its way to not give users any info when a world is private.",
